OL,3,GNEWSAMountain Road to close daily this
OL,4,Aweek
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Isle of Man's Mountain Road will
OL,7,Fclose daily this week while equipment
OL,8,Ffrom the Manx Grand Prix and Classic TT
OL,9,Fis removed.
OL,11,FMonday, Tuesday and Wednesday: Ramsey
OL,12,FHairpin to the Bungalow, 09:30 to 16:00
OL,14,FThursday and Friday: Bungalow to
OL,15,FCreg-ny-Baa, 09:30 to 16:00
OL,17,FHighway Services said the arrangements
OL,18,Fwere needed to safely remove all
OL,19,Frace-related equipment from the
OL,20,FMountain Course.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
